Package: officequarto
Title: Word Style, Table, Figure, and Metadata Write-Back for Quarto DOCX Output
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("trekonom", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "moogs@gmx.de")
Description: Provides the officequarto Quarto extension (bundled under
    inst/_extensions) and its post-render write-back hook: applies
    user-configured paragraph/table/figure style mapping, table and figure
    caption formatting, page layout, free-form style-map, and cross-reference
    options to a rendered .docx, and prunes styles Pandoc added but that are
    absent from the reference document. Also provides
    oq_create_project() to scaffold a new project with the
    extension and a reference document already in place.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://trekonom.github.io/officequarto/, https://github.com/trekonom/officequarto
